    "rich_text_section": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_main": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "REPURPOSE OLD JEWELRY INTO SOMETHING YOU'LL WEAR",
            "heading_tag_h1": false,
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_main": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you have old jewelry sitting in a drawer, I can repurpose it into something you'll actually wear. I use your own gems to adapt one of my designs or create something entirely new, working with your materials preserves sentimental value, saves cost, and reduces environmental impact.</p><p>If you have old gold or platinum jewelry you no longer wear, I can refine it and apply its full value toward your new piece. I'm committed to transparent, eco-friendly refining, fair pricing, and working within your budget. </p><p>Ready to start? Send photos of your jewelry or gems and share your vision. Together, we'll transform your materials into a piece you'll truly treasure.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_lead": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whether it’s revitalizing a cherished heirloom, adapting one of my designs, or creating something new, I’m happy to use your gems. Using your materials preserves sentimental value, cuts costs, and reduces environmental impact.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_lead",
